Comment:
 The pristine upstream shell helper is shipped as documentation
 (upstream/firmware.sh). The installed helper is a minimal reviewed patch
 that pins runtime-downloaded code to immutable commits and verifies its
 SHA-256 before execution. The rights below are as carried in the file
 itself (MIT on lines 3-24, plus a nested Python SPDX tag) and the
 MIT SPDX tag of the embedded Python archive-renamer. Optional runtime
 downloads are separate assets and are not bundled.

